WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.210 --> 00:03.800
[This series contains scenes of violence, self-harm, and potential triggers.]

4
00:03.380 --> 00:03.880
Hello.

5
00:03.800 --> 00:05.120
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

6
00:04.100 --> 00:05.180
Hello.

7
00:06.290 --> 00:07.490
What's your name?

8
00:08.170 --> 00:09.790
Lee Soohyun.

9
00:10.570 --> 00:12.420
[Resume Name: Lee Soohyun]

10
00:12.420 --> 00:15.260
[Staff: Lee Doyoon]

11
00:15.990 --> 00:16.730
Doyoon,

12
00:16.770 --> 00:18.220
watch the register for me.

13
00:18.220 --> 00:19.150
Coming!

14
00:22.000 --> 00:23.000
May I take your order?

15
00:23.000 --> 00:24.830
An iced Americano, please.

16
00:25.070 --> 00:25.810
Okay.

17
00:28.520 --> 00:29.720
That's 4,700 won.

18
01:01.490 --> 01:05.670
[Lee Doyoon, Yoon Seojin, Lee Wonwoo, Lee Chaeha...]

19
01:10.420 --> 01:11.680
Please show me your ID.

20
01:16.100 --> 01:19.140
[ID Card: Lee Hanyul]

21
01:19.200 --> 01:19.789
Okay.

22
01:19.970 --> 01:21.030
That's 10,000 won.

23
01:22.380 --> 01:23.760
-Thank you. -Goodbye.

24
01:24.740 --> 01:27.770
[Cheongun-ru Restaurant]

25
01:30.160 --> 01:31.110
Chaeha.

26
01:31.640 --> 01:32.590
Yes?

27
01:37.130 --> 01:38.509
Your ID card.

28
01:39.020 --> 01:40.509
-Ah... -"Ah."

29
01:40.530 --> 01:41.840
-Right. -"Right."

30
01:41.979 --> 01:43.640
Gosh, you forgot it again?

31
01:43.759 --> 01:45.509
I knew this would happen.

32
01:46.190 --> 01:48.070
I lost my ID card

33
01:48.210 --> 01:49.970
and haven't had time to get a new one.

34
01:49.970 --> 01:52.050
What are you so busy with all day?

35
01:52.200 --> 01:53.860
Go apply for a new ID tomorrow.

36
01:53.860 --> 01:54.940
You can come to work late.

37
01:54.940 --> 01:55.960
Got it?

38
01:57.020 --> 01:58.360
Boss.

39
01:58.590 --> 02:00.950
I don't need the employee insurance benefits.

40
02:00.950 --> 02:02.480
Can't I just work without it?

41
02:02.480 --> 02:03.570
What?

42
02:04.140 --> 02:05.470
Don't tell me you are...

43
02:07.620 --> 02:08.860
a credit delinquent?

44
02:08.990 --> 02:11.020
Of course not.

45
02:11.150 --> 02:12.100
Then...

46
02:12.270 --> 02:13.840
an illegal immigrant?

47
02:14.000 --> 02:14.950
No.

48
02:15.070 --> 02:15.970
-Right? -Yeah.

49
02:16.010 --> 02:17.480
Our restaurant follows the rules.

50
02:17.480 --> 02:18.910
I register all my employees.

51
02:18.910 --> 02:20.370
Make sure to bring your ID by next week.

52
02:20.370 --> 02:21.400
Got it?

53
02:22.030 --> 02:22.950
Yes.

54
02:25.220 --> 02:31.810
[Some scenes were created with AI.]

55
02:34.090 --> 02:37.820
[Adapted from the webtoon "The Sound of Sugar Cubes" by Kim Tak]

56
02:37.820 --> 02:40.630
[Screenwriter: So-on (JD)]

57
02:40.660 --> 02:43.520
[Director: Yoon Jinyoung]

58
03:00.080 --> 03:01.420
[Yoo Dohyun]

59
03:01.600 --> 03:03.230
[Cho Chanhyeon]

60
03:03.340 --> 03:04.860
[Ko Gyeol]

61
03:06.550 --> 03:09.780
[The Sound of Sugar Cubes]

62
04:02.000 --> 04:03.550
[Cheongun-ru Restaurant]

63
04:05.110 --> 04:07.210
Hello, this is Cheongun-ru.

64
04:12.710 --> 04:15.170
Looks like I need to find a new part-time job.

65
04:15.270 --> 04:17.940
Oh, yes. Your order is on its way.

66
04:19.320 --> 04:20.410
Sorry?

67
04:21.870 --> 04:24.130
You want it delivered inside your house?

68
04:24.290 --> 04:25.440
Oh, okay.

69
04:25.620 --> 04:26.640
Okay, got it.

70
04:26.880 --> 04:29.010
Yes, your food will be there shortly.

71
04:30.660 --> 04:32.659
Delivered inside the house? Weird.

72
04:33.690 --> 04:34.600
Chaeha.

73
04:35.000 --> 04:36.760
This delivery is for Block A, Unit 102, right?

74
04:36.760 --> 04:37.630
Yes.

75
04:37.640 --> 04:39.360
They asked to have it delivered inside.

76
04:39.360 --> 04:40.500
Inside the house.

77
04:40.680 --> 04:42.670
Okay, got it.

78
05:36.640 --> 05:37.690
Yes, Boss.

79
05:38.370 --> 05:39.510
It's been handled.

80
05:41.280 --> 05:42.320
Understood.

81
05:52.300 --> 05:53.760
Everything is ready.

82
05:55.110 --> 05:56.210
Please come in.

83
06:10.190 --> 06:11.420
Delivery.

84
06:17.210 --> 06:18.620
Delivery!

85
06:23.150 --> 06:24.840
They asked to have it delivered inside.

86
06:24.840 --> 06:26.020
Inside the house.

87
06:27.400 --> 06:28.480
Inside the house.

88
07:02.130 --> 07:03.070
Oh?

89
07:05.850 --> 07:07.220
Delivery.

90
07:07.860 --> 07:11.100
Was that you singing just now?

91
07:11.700 --> 07:13.330
Pay for your food.

92
07:14.720 --> 07:16.860
Your singing still sucks.

93
07:18.650 --> 07:20.650
Don't tell me you want to be a singer.

94
07:20.920 --> 07:22.580
Just pay for your food.

95
07:27.140 --> 07:28.310
Wait here.

96
07:34.900 --> 07:36.900
He really likes making people wait.

97
08:07.620 --> 08:08.990
Look at this punk.

98
08:17.250 --> 08:18.850
Hello, this is Cheongun-ru.

99
08:19.020 --> 08:21.470
I just ordered delivery to Block A, Unit 102.

100
08:21.470 --> 08:23.610
Oh, um, has it not arrived yet?

101
08:24.010 --> 08:24.960
It has, but

102
08:25.400 --> 08:27.690
the delivery guy stole my money.

103
08:27.860 --> 08:29.900
Huh? Chaeha did that?

104
08:30.680 --> 08:32.970
Oh, gosh, um, I'm so sorry.

105
08:34.270 --> 08:35.429
Chaeha...

106
08:36.780 --> 08:37.900
Is his name Chaeha?

107
08:38.080 --> 08:40.429
Yes. When he comes back, I'll teach him a good lesson.

108
08:40.429 --> 08:42.909
I'll get him to apologize and return the money to you.

109
08:42.909 --> 08:43.970
No, just fire him.

110
08:44.039 --> 08:44.780
Sorry?

111
08:44.920 --> 08:47.010
This employee seems problematic.

112
08:47.140 --> 08:48.580
Are you going to keep him?

113
08:49.260 --> 08:50.670
Oh, of course not.

114
08:50.950 --> 08:52.720
You don't need to return the money.

115
08:52.720 --> 08:54.340
Oh, okay. Sorr...

116
08:56.070 --> 08:58.210
Son of a... Rude bastard.

117
08:58.550 --> 08:59.860
Damn it.

118
09:15.510 --> 09:16.700
Chaeha.

119
09:18.500 --> 09:21.630
So I couldn't find you all this time because of your name.

120
09:27.350 --> 09:28.850
I'm back.

121
09:29.300 --> 09:30.300
Lee Chaeha!

122
09:30.300 --> 09:31.840
Did you steal from the customer's wallet?

123
09:31.840 --> 09:32.620
Huh?

124
09:32.740 --> 09:34.140
The customer just called

125
09:34.180 --> 09:36.100
saying you stole from his wallet!

126
09:37.650 --> 09:39.070
I just took the money for the food,

127
09:39.070 --> 09:40.660
since he looked busy with work.

128
09:40.660 --> 09:42.100
You dummy!

129
09:45.120 --> 09:47.320
Today is your last day. Don't come back!

130
09:47.360 --> 09:50.270
I only have myself to blame for hiring someone without an ID.

131
09:50.270 --> 09:51.900
I'm the idiot.

132
10:04.220 --> 10:08.200
Since you stole the money, we're even for this month's wages.

133
10:08.330 --> 10:09.590
What do you mean steal?

134
10:14.310 --> 10:17.260
[High-paying part-time job: Massage Therapist]

135
10:22.610 --> 10:23.900
[High-paying part-time job: Massage Therapist]

136
10:28.640 --> 10:31.200
[High-paying part-time job: Massage Therapist]

137
10:43.140 --> 10:46.410
I see. 173cm, 58kg?

138
10:46.530 --> 10:47.770
Nice.

139
10:48.130 --> 10:49.710
See you later.

140
11:01.490 --> 11:02.630
Massage?

141
11:07.950 --> 11:10.080
Are you the one I talked to on the phone?

142
11:13.590 --> 11:14.800
I...

143
11:15.430 --> 11:16.650
I don't think I can do this.

144
11:16.650 --> 11:18.190
Please leave...

145
11:20.620 --> 11:22.330
You're quite hot.

146
11:50.170 --> 11:51.720
You were so hard to find.

147
11:52.050 --> 11:53.150
Hello.

148
11:54.230 --> 11:55.220
You...

149
11:55.450 --> 11:56.770
Are you crazy?

150
11:56.910 --> 11:58.560
Why did you choke him?

151
12:00.080 --> 12:01.370
He isn't dead.

152
12:01.700 --> 12:03.270
I just choked him out.

153
12:05.740 --> 12:07.530
I need to talk to you.

154
12:09.380 --> 12:11.180
I couldn't let him take you away.

155
12:12.760 --> 12:14.690
I'm good at giving massages too.

156
12:16.260 --> 12:17.480
Just kidding.

157
12:19.410 --> 12:20.940
You should try out for this.

158
12:22.660 --> 12:24.570
[Super Singer Audition]

159
12:27.370 --> 12:28.610
Why should I?

160
12:30.650 --> 12:32.330
If you don't,

161
12:33.860 --> 12:35.960
I'll report you to the police for stealing.

162
12:35.960 --> 12:37.220
Hey, I didn't steal...

163
12:37.340 --> 12:40.270
Oh, and the side of pickled radish wasn't delivered.

164
12:40.500 --> 12:42.180
That's a crime too.

165
12:43.320 --> 12:45.400
The crime of missing radish.

166
12:46.170 --> 12:47.520
Get lost.

167
12:49.040 --> 12:50.970
I signed you up with your real name.

168
12:53.120 --> 12:55.180
Since your real name is pretty.

169
12:56.050 --> 13:00.380
[Super Singer Open Audition: Lee Hanyul]

170
13:05.300 --> 13:06.520
You...

171
13:07.000 --> 13:08.490
Who are you?

172
13:09.110 --> 13:10.150
Me?

173
13:11.300 --> 13:12.930
Someone who makes music.

174
13:13.500 --> 13:14.810
My name is Lee Won.

175
13:18.070 --> 13:20.870
Can I become a songwriter like Lee Won?

176
13:24.060 --> 13:25.970
1 PM at my place tomorrow.

177
13:26.290 --> 13:27.890
You know the address, right?

178
13:30.720 --> 13:33.780
You're running around incognito.

179
13:34.330 --> 13:36.590
There's no need to make an enemy out of me,

180
13:37.330 --> 13:38.990
Mr. Missing Radish Criminal.

181
14:02.660 --> 14:04.110
That jerk...

182
14:04.360 --> 14:05.790
is Lee Won?

183
14:09.770 --> 14:12.070
It's good, right? Super good, right?

184
14:13.650 --> 14:15.140
Don't force it on me.

185
14:16.150 --> 14:18.180
This is the songwriter Lee Won's new song.

186
14:18.180 --> 14:19.550
That Lee Won again?

187
14:19.890 --> 14:22.430
Sorry? "That Lee Won"? The disrespect.

188
14:22.430 --> 14:23.850
Is he your friend?

189
14:24.500 --> 14:25.890
Funny you should mention that.

190
14:25.890 --> 14:28.290
Is he your friend? I'm the one who's your friend.

191
14:27.990 --> 14:30.540
[Adolf] [Lee Hanyul]

192
14:28.890 --> 14:29.940
Forget it.

193
14:32.240 --> 14:34.680
Hey, are you jealous?

194
14:35.070 --> 14:36.510
Why'd I be jealous?

195
14:36.660 --> 14:37.990
You are jealous!

196
14:38.130 --> 14:39.420
I'm not!

197
14:40.630 --> 14:42.150
Don't be jealous.

198
14:43.260 --> 14:45.790
I'll love him from afar forever.

199
14:46.860 --> 14:47.780
Tsk.

200
15:11.940 --> 15:12.770
Here.

201
15:12.900 --> 15:14.730
The radish you didn't get last time.

202
15:14.730 --> 15:17.920
Make sure you drink every last drop of the brine.

203
15:20.690 --> 15:22.400
And this is the money I took.

204
15:22.780 --> 15:23.790
As for

205
15:23.950 --> 15:25.050
the audition,

206
15:25.620 --> 15:26.960
I'm not participating.

207
15:32.140 --> 15:33.890
Y-route's leader Herod

208
15:34.030 --> 15:37.160
has gained immense popularity with his aloof charm.

209
15:37.290 --> 15:39.790
Herod, please say hello to our audience.

210
15:40.550 --> 15:41.810
Hello, everyone.

211
15:42.340 --> 15:43.310
I'm Herod.

212
15:43.740 --> 15:46.940
You're unveiling your title track "Sound of Dawn" today.

213
15:46.980 --> 15:51.040
I heard you actually wrote the lyrics and composed the music yourself.

214
15:51.930 --> 15:53.070
Yes.

215
15:53.400 --> 15:54.970
That's impressive.

216
15:55.110 --> 15:58.630
Herod, could you give us a little preview?

217
16:00.890 --> 16:03.010
The sound of dawn,

218
16:03.180 --> 16:06.740
my breath calling out to you.

219
16:07.310 --> 16:14.160
It may fade into the distance, yet it still reaches toward you.

220
16:14.600 --> 16:16.980
The sound of dawn,

221
16:17.130 --> 16:20.310
amid the stars that have quietly fallen into slumber.

222
16:20.590 --> 16:24.580
Even as it softly echoes,

223
16:24.740 --> 16:28.410
I am still here, waiting for you.

224
16:31.030 --> 16:32.330
How is it?

225
16:32.870 --> 16:33.970
It's good.

226
16:34.010 --> 16:36.370
It's way better than what that Lee Won wrote.

227
16:36.370 --> 16:37.370
Really?

228
16:37.570 --> 16:40.430
I wrote it with your voice in mind.

229
16:40.690 --> 16:41.840
Really?

230
16:42.260 --> 16:45.520
Was it you singing just now?

231
16:48.230 --> 16:49.740
Was it your voice?

232
16:49.800 --> 16:51.010
Who are you?

233
16:52.400 --> 16:53.960
The idol Herod.

234
16:56.470 --> 16:57.750
Sing it again.

235
16:59.250 --> 17:00.420
Why should I?

236
17:02.000 --> 17:03.550
Because I want to hear it.

237
17:04.960 --> 17:06.440
Who do you think you are?

238
17:10.180 --> 17:13.109
Hanyul's voice sure is in great demand.

239
17:13.430 --> 17:15.089
Do you want to join our agency?

240
17:15.349 --> 17:16.810
Wow. Really?

241
17:17.010 --> 17:18.390
I'm not interested.

242
17:19.109 --> 17:21.640
Hey, why are you saying things you don't mean?

243
17:22.230 --> 17:25.359
Our agency is going to hold a Super Singer audition soon.

244
17:25.839 --> 17:27.609
I'll put in a good word for you.

245
17:27.720 --> 17:28.770
Come try out.

246
17:31.400 --> 17:32.480
Your number.

247
17:37.690 --> 17:39.140
What are you doing?

248
17:40.090 --> 17:41.370
This is my number.

249
17:42.120 --> 17:43.270
Save it.

250
17:50.170 --> 17:52.540
Hanyul, are you going to debut?

251
17:53.300 --> 17:55.960
Oh, please. He just asked me to join an audition.

252
17:57.150 --> 17:59.410
He said he'd put in a good word for you!

253
18:02.670 --> 18:04.100
Do you know how many people

254
18:04.100 --> 18:05.770
audition for such a big agency?

255
18:05.770 --> 18:09.030
But he gave you his number. That must mean something.

256
18:09.720 --> 18:11.850
Hey, do you want to audition too?

257
18:12.090 --> 18:13.520
M-Me?

258
18:13.660 --> 18:15.280
Yeah, let's do it together.

259
18:15.750 --> 18:17.920
He didn't mention me at all.

260
18:18.060 --> 18:21.140
That's because he hasn't heard you sing.

261
18:21.790 --> 18:23.660
No need. Forget it.

262
18:25.720 --> 18:27.050
You're mad, aren't you?

263
18:27.510 --> 18:28.280
I'm not mad.

264
18:28.440 --> 18:30.040
You're mad he didn't ask you.

265
18:30.050 --> 18:31.230
I said I'm not mad.

266
18:31.400 --> 18:32.430
You're so mad.

267
18:32.570 --> 18:34.310
I said I'm not mad! You really...

268
18:34.310 --> 18:36.100
You turd!

269
18:40.650 --> 18:41.840
Lee Hanyul!

270
18:43.060 --> 18:44.210
Lee Hanyul!

271
18:45.230 --> 18:46.410
Lee Hanyul!

272
18:47.750 --> 18:49.880
Lee Hanyul, let's go to the music room!

273
18:56.100 --> 18:59.340
Hey, where's Lee Hanyul?

274
19:00.230 --> 19:02.820
He just left with Adolf, I think.

275
19:21.400 --> 19:23.440
The position of your hand should be like this.

276
19:23.440 --> 19:24.580
Lee Hanyul.

277
19:24.920 --> 19:26.450
Oh, you're here.

278
19:26.650 --> 19:27.660
Herod.

279
19:30.450 --> 19:32.540
What are you two doing?

280
19:34.140 --> 19:37.310
He's pestering me, saying he wants to try composing too.

281
19:37.320 --> 19:39.180
Isn't it just pressing some keys?

282
19:39.540 --> 19:40.770
Hey.

283
19:41.370 --> 19:44.120
Your hand position is wrong to begin with.

284
19:45.350 --> 19:47.240
Like this with your left hand

285
19:47.950 --> 19:49.090
and like this

286
19:49.290 --> 19:50.400
with your right.

287
19:54.340 --> 19:55.570
Oh, right, Herod,

288
19:55.760 --> 19:57.750
your agency's audition you mentioned,

289
19:57.750 --> 19:59.350
can Adolf try out too?

290
20:00.030 --> 20:01.020
Don't.

291
20:01.400 --> 20:02.600
Why?

292
20:02.900 --> 20:04.200
Please, Herod,

293
20:04.220 --> 20:05.900
you can make it happen, right?

294
20:05.930 --> 20:07.260
Please do us this favor.

295
20:07.270 --> 20:08.370
He can really sing.

296
20:08.490 --> 20:09.640
Give him a chance.

297
20:11.400 --> 20:12.270
Okay.

298
20:12.500 --> 20:13.880
-Really? -Really?

299
20:14.960 --> 20:16.820
I can't thank you enough.

300
20:17.530 --> 20:19.930
No, I should be thanking you.

301
20:20.650 --> 20:22.430
By the way, your song at the audition...

302
20:22.430 --> 20:23.070
Yeah,

303
20:23.200 --> 20:24.030
I've decided.

304
20:24.290 --> 20:25.260
Which song?

305
20:25.900 --> 20:27.240
Sound of Dawn.

306
20:28.110 --> 20:30.800
But no one knows this song.

307
20:30.950 --> 20:32.810
Didn't you say you wrote it for me?

308
20:32.990 --> 20:35.160
It's the only song like it in the world.

309
20:35.170 --> 20:37.070
A song made just for my voice.

310
20:39.440 --> 20:42.130
Wow, Sound of Dawn.

311
20:42.250 --> 20:44.170
Herod, absolutely no one can

312
20:44.180 --> 20:45.970
pull off this song but you.

313
20:46.280 --> 20:47.250
Really?

314
20:48.890 --> 20:50.970
What do you want from me?

315
20:51.420 --> 20:52.650
I told you

316
20:52.800 --> 20:55.260
I want you to join the Super Singer audition,

317
20:55.750 --> 20:58.840
Lee Hanyul.

318
21:00.420 --> 21:02.410
If you make it to the finals,

319
21:02.880 --> 21:04.680
I'll help you get that song back.

320
21:08.680 --> 21:09.890
How about it?

321
21:10.490 --> 21:13.550
This is your only chance to get your friend's song back.

322
21:16.270 --> 21:17.870
This time...

323
21:24.470 --> 21:25.840
If you still...

324
21:29.300 --> 21:30.910
Go to hell, you bastard!

325
21:31.580 --> 21:32.840
This is unbelievable.

326
21:32.910 --> 21:33.910
Are you filming?

327
21:36.540 --> 21:38.070
Do nothing...

328
21:39.700 --> 21:41.000
It was so cringe watching him

329
21:41.000 --> 21:43.950
show off on the piano in the music room, pretending to be a composer.

330
